		{
			description: [
				"&4Princess sylvi &fof the ruling &bice tribe &fwas renowned as fierce warrior but best known for her remarkable intellect and aptitude for battle strategy."
				""
				"When her father was &ckilled &fin battle she fully expected to ascend &6the throne. &fHer uncle ragnar however had other plans and at the conclave opposed her rule gaining support from majority of the &bice tribes."
				""
				"因此，&4sylvi &f被迫流亡。那段时期究竟发生了什么无人知晓，但当&4她&f归来时，一支由&0堕落军团兵&f组成的军队正紧随其后。"
				""
				"She would decimate her uncles forces and personally send him to &3niflheim. &fAfter putting the rest of the traitorous leaders to the sword and reclaiming her birthright &4she &fwould set her sights on the neighbouring kingdoms. "
				""
				"当有人提议称她为&4\"堕落女王\"&f时，她拒绝了，坚持要使用&4\"堕落之王\"&f的头衔来致敬先于她的人们。"
